#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user-docs/C/default-apps.xml:22
msgid ""
"By default, Xubuntu displays a number of commonly used applications in the "
"<guilabel>Favorites</guilabel> category of the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject "
"role=\"icon-menu\"><imageobject><imagedata role=\"icon\" "
"fileref=\"../libs/images/icon_menu.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon>"
" <guibutton>Applications Menu</guibutton>. These applications include the "
"software manager, word processor, and help documentation, as well as the "
"default web browser and file manager. To add or remove entries from the "
"<guilabel>Favorites</guilabel> category, right-click on an application entry"
" and select the <guilabel>Add to Favorites</guilabel> or <guilabel>Remove "
"from Favorites</guilabel> entry in the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Por defeito, o Xubuntu apresenta as aplicações mais utilizadas habitualmente"
" na categoria <guilabel>Favoritos</guilabel> do <guiicon><inlinemediaobject "
