#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user-docs/C/settings-personalization.xml:58
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Xubuntu 18.04 (Bionic)</guibutton> - This was the default panel "
"layout used in Xubuntu’s 2018 LTS release and is similar to the "
"<guilabel>Xubuntu 14.04 (Trusty)</guilabel> panel layout, with the addition "
