"role=\"icon-pkg\"><imageobject><imagedata role=\"icon-pad\" "
"fileref=\"../../libs-"
"common/images/icon_package.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject><ulink "
"url=\"apt://plank\">plank</ulink></literal>), DockbarX (<ulink "
